"cli.usage" = "AgentRoomWorktree — AgentRoomWorktree CLI (helpers dual-entry)

Commands:
  capabilities              Print the app interop contract ({ok,result} envelope)
  version, -V, --version    Print CLI stamp
  help, -h, --help          This help
  open                      Open the GUI app (via /usr/bin/open)
  status                    Bind count
  provision                 Room concept → git worktree → MD
  bind                      Record roomID ↔ worktree
  emit-md                   Write ROOM.md DESIGN.md AGENTS.md
  list                      List binds
  show                      Show one bind
  doctor                    Check binds, worktrees, MD files

Next steps (contract · ship · MR): agent-cli-scaffold checklist --app agent-room-worktree

Install after the feature MR is merged:
  app-build-manager ship apps/<app> release

Examples:
  agent-room-worktree provision --task "…" --verify "…" --repo PATH --dry-run --json
  agent-room-worktree list --json";
